            <ArticleTitle>Pain: geriatric self-learning module.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>399-404</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Geriatric Resource Nurse Model is used at the University of Virginia to improve the competency of staff in caring for older adults. Eight self-learning educational modules were developed to address common concerns in hospitalized elders. The Pain: Geriatric Self-Learning Module to published here, along with a post-test. This is the second in a four-part publication of self-learning modules.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
